OL,3,GNEWSAFive men arrested as
OL,4,Acounter-terror police investigate major
OL,5,Aincident near RAF Fairford
OL,6,
OL,7,FCounter-terror police are leading an
OL,8,Finvestigation in which five men were
OL,9,Farrested on suspicion of explosives
OL,10,Foffences and preparation of a terrorist
OL,11,Fact near an RAF base which hosts the
OL,12,FUnited States Air Force (USAF).
OL,14,FThe men were detained after police
OL,15,Freceived a report of "three suspicious
OL,16,Fvehicles" travelling towards RAF
OL,17,FFairford in Gloucestershire at about
OL,18,F00:45 BST on Sunday, officers said.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
