OL,3,GNEWSAFive men arrested as
OL,4,Acounter-terror police investigate major
OL,5,Aincident near RAF Fairford
OL,6,
OL,7,FA major incident was declared and an
OL,8,FArmy explosive ordnance disposal team
OL,9,Fhas been examining vehicles near the
OL,10,Fbase.
OL,12,FEighty-five households in the nearby
OL,13,Fvillage of Whelford have been evacuated
OL,14,Fwhile investigations continue.
OL,15,FOfficials believe the incident is
OL,16,Fcontained.
